    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pulcher</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-cer</span></b> ), chri, m., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pul-chra</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-cra</span></b> ), ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				Roman surname of the</i> Claudii (Clodii), <i><span class="en">Liv. 38,
